  unitName: Holy Thunder Eze
  unitId: 40015
  unitNumber: 341
  description: A warrior from the ruined Atharva Republic, he later became one of
    the Six Heroes. It was Eze who saved the republic's female general Emilia during
    the intense battle with the gods. At that time Emilia spoke to Eze, who then
    began to overflow with more explosive power than ever before. Eze later boasted
    of what Emilia had told him to a friend. Apparently, she had said "You're not
    just some idiot. You're an idiot to be respected."
  summonDesc: My Batootha is pleased!<br>It's happy to be in existence at<br>the
    same time as me!!
  fusionDesc: Wooooow!<br>Gimme more!<br>I'm gonna destroy them all!!
  evoDesc: Listen up!<br>The greatest idiot swordsman<br>on earth is me!!
  element: 4
  rarity: 5
